# CStreamInfo.outputDelay samples after the frame, and honours GstAudioClippingMeta. The decoder
# runs without the look-ahead post-processes, so the delay is the codec's own (962 for SBR).
# Draining takes the delayed samples with AACDEC_FLUSH. See patches/README.md.
